{"resourceIdentifier":"4531","resourceName":"Reducing Gas Leakages within the Hududgaz Gas Distribution Networks across Uzbekistan","description":"The proposed project aims to reduce gas leakages from components in the natural gas transmission and distribution system operated by Hududgaz Gas Transmission and Distribution Company Limited across Uzbekistan. The project activity will reduce natural gas leakage in the transmission and distribution network of Hududgaz in the project area through the implementation of advanced leak detection and repairs (LDAR) procedures using advanced leak detection and measurement technology such as HiFlow Samplers. Leak Measurement Devices and Gasurveyors. The project activities will include inspection and leak measurements, as well as repair works at components in the natural gas above ground distribution system using advanced repair materials.","location":{"latitude":41.286143,"longitude":69.233298},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-08-28","endExclusive":"2023-09-28","endInclusive":"2023-09-27"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4531"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"GasGreen Asia LLC"},{"type":"string","value":"MD, United States"},{"type":"string","value":"+1 202- 340-1112"},{"type":"string","value":"kjames@gasgreenasia.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"4531"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"7354473"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Fugitive emissions from fuels (solid, oil and gas)"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AM0023"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Carbon Check (India) Private Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGIST